<title>USA: Milton, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</title>
<headline>Milton, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Bank said it won $1.100 million of Milton, Wis., general obligation promissory notes,  with a true interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
</text>
